From tru64-unix-managers  Thu Apr 25 19:31:32 2002
From: "Brewer, Edward" <BREWERE () OD ! NIH ! GOV>
Date: Thu, 25 Apr 2002 19:31:32 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: Summary: Question concerning large number of files and transfer t	o
