Hi again everybody!

Big thanx to Bruce Hines, Corinne Haesaerts and Stephen Lowe!

36 GB disk are supported, with version 5.7 of the HSOF. You should be aware
of some power-problems though:

"We had single 120 watt psu on each shelf, Compaq told us to make sure each
shelf had dual power supplies preferably 180 watt but 120's should be OK if
two used. The 36 gig drives take more current than smaller disks."

For specs. on HSOF 5.7 see the attached PDF.

Kind regards
Danny Petterson

