Hello

Does anyone know if PK1 on V5.1A causes problems with sysman ? We had a
problem last night trying to run sysman to change some network settings.
Sysman would start but when trying to access any of the options we were told
that the necessary subset wasn't installed. Reinstalling the subset that has
the sysman tools in it (sorry I can't remember the name) cured the problem.
I assume this installed the original version in place of the patched
version.
It works now but I was curious....

Regards

Kevin Jones


