Hi!

I found a solution:

First backup the entire /usr/net/servers/lanman-directory (just in =
case)
Stop asu
Delete the file with the domainname in /usr/net/servers/lanman/domains
Delete lsa /usr/net/servers/lanman/datafiles
Run asusetup, and reconfigure it all...do NOT use the default-answers, =
even
if its the same data, type them again. This will recreate lsa, sam and =
acl,
and everything works fine.

