I have placed uaio v2.3t2 of under:

ftp://ftp.alaska.edu/pub/sois/Software.html#uaio
ftp://ftp.alaska.edu/pub/sois/uaio.tar.Z

This will compile and run on Tru64 v5.1 (or v4.0).

I have not thoroughly tested this on v5.x, but it
does build and run (unlike the previous version).

I still do not have direct access to a v5.x system and
I do not presently have the resources to figure out
how to map TBL_DKINFO back to the bus structure,
so the uaio summaries by bus are presently not
correct.  If somebody has some suggestions on
how to decipher that please send them... it likely
is a trivial coding change if I know where to 
extract the info.

My apologies for being slow to release this code...
I had it working last summer through the courtesy
of Jim Fitzmaurice (fnal.gov) granting me access
to machine to test on.  However, I knew then the
device to bus mapping was wrong and intended to
fix it, but still don't have direct access to
a machine, information, or source to figure it
out.  So, here it is anyway.  Kurt
