To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: LSM at Startup - More Info
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=102653755322229

I guess I wasn't detailed enough on my last response.  I am running version
5.1 on a ES40.  It is not a clustered environment.  What I mean by setting
everything back up is when I rebooted the system - I needed to do the
following:

 volsetup and/or voldiskadd
     volinstall
     vold -m disable
     voldctl init
     voldg init rootdg

Then I created the volumes with volassist

I did not need to recreate the advfs - I just needed to mount them.
Hopefully, this help out.

Lisa
