Morning Admins,

 

I am just about to begin a patch upgrade (t64v51b18as0004-20011114) on two
ES40 clusters running C2.

I would be grateful if you could share your experiences, problems and known
"gotcha's".

 

Especially, are there any additional patches recommended subsequent to
t64v51b18as0004-20011114

 

