     -Vinny Kiely,John Losey,Riaz Shaukaut,Raul Sossa, Pat O' Brien,Bill
Boody, Chris Bryant ,Dan Harrington, Jan Mark Holzer , Corinne Haesaerts,
John McNulty and Murtaza Talawala.

Solution to my problem is to trawl through the /var/adm/messages or run a
dia -R or to use the utility emxmgr  and to get the driver version for the
HBA use sysconfig -q emx - also to take a look at the uerf with "uerf -Rr
300 | more "

