Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit

As usual, the list members came up with answers in 5 Minutes! I needed
to explicitly declare my environment so that the cron job could run
correctly as suggested by David Hull, Mike Mehall, Michael Bucholtz,
Andy Cohen, Oisin McGuiness, and Dr. Thomas Blinn.
 
I added the following line at the start of the script and it started
working correctly:
 
source <insert-path-here>/.cshrc
 
Thanks again!
 
Regards,
 
Ralf
 

