Sorry for the delay on this summary. Thanks to everyone who replied, this is 
the response I generally got. This worked:

Steve, try the following on the Alpha 500:

Add client to the Xserver:
unix> xhost +server_name  -- where server_name is the hostname of machine

Then you need to set the display:
unix> DISPLAY=server_name:0.0  -- where server_name is the hostname of
machine
unix export DISPLAY

And try again

This was my problem
