Tru64 managers,

I program a PCI driver for Tru64 5.1. But sometimes I will meet the
following problem. When I use
#sysconfig -u gfncd
to unconfigure my pci driver, it will report:
framework error: connection timeout
And the dynamic kernel module becomes "load and unconfiugred"
Then I can not use some command yet, I press
#netstat -in
And no any printout on the screen. The command is hung up.

What's the problem? If someone knows, please help me.

TIA,

Barry



