Ok...a couple of questions about NetRAIN have come up around here.  We =
are currently running NetRAIN on our 5.1 and 5.1a servers between two =
NIC cards.  What we want is to add a third card to the systems...can =
this be added to the existing NetRAIN set?  And if so, would it be as =
simple as:

                    /sbin/ifconfig nr0 10.0.202.37  netmask =
255.255.255.0 add ee0,ee1,ee2

The other question is about NetRAIN functionality.  I remember a while =
ago a Compaq support guy said that NetRAIN would be able to do load =
sharing at some point in the future.  Has this been implemented yet?  =
Could we run load sharing on the three cards?  Or two cards?  Or is it =
still just a simple failover mechanism?  It just seems silly to have =
three cards in the system, and having two of them idle all the time.  =
Anyway, thanks in advance.=20

Jonathan Williams
Unix Systems Administrator
The Shubert Organization, Inc.

